From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:29:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(web): close the open-items panel when a comment is
 started from it

With item comments and the header's open-items button both present,
choosing Comment in an item's preview opened from the button's panel
switches the composer to comment mode while the panel is still up; on a
phone the panel is a sheet over the composer. The panel now closes on a
comment request, as it does for "Show in conversation".

The docs and the browser test of item comments named the Open items bar;
with the button they go through the header's panel.

Local only: glue between the chat-item-comments and
open-items-links-compact series, neither of which is upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
